sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PR as PayrollRun (status trigger)
    participant HF as Hangfire
    participant JOB as GenerateSalarySlipsJob
    participant PDF as PdfGeneratorService (QuestPDF)
    participant STOR as StorageService (Supabase Storage)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MAIL as EmailService (Resend/MailKit)
    participant EMP as Employee
    participant WH as WebhookDispatcherService

    PR->>HF: status becomes APPROVED → enqueue job(payrollRunId)
    HF->>JOB: Execute(payrollRunId)
    JOB->>DB: SELECT all PayrollEntry WHERE payroll_run_id

    loop for each PayrollEntry
        JOB->>DB: load Company info (logo, name, address)
        JOB->>PDF: BuildSlip(entry, components, company)
        PDF-->>JOB: PDF bytes
        JOB->>STOR: upload /slips/{companyId}/{yyyy}/{mm}/{employeeCode}.pdf
        STOR-->>JOB: signed URL (1-hour expiry)
        JOB->>DB: INSERT SalarySlip (PdfUrl, Version=1)
        JOB->>HF: enqueue email delivery job(slipId)
    end

    par email delivery (async, per slip)
        HF->>MAIL: send PDF to employee's registered email
        MAIL-->>EMP: "Your salary slip for July 2025 is ready" + PDF
        MAIL->>DB: UPDATE SalarySlip.EmailSentAt, EmailSentTo
    end

    JOB->>WH: fire webhook "payroll.slips_generated"

    Note over EMP,DB: Employee later opens slip via signed URL →<br/>UPDATE SalarySlip.ViewedAt
    Note over EMP,DB: Third party (bank/embassy) can hit the public<br/>GET /slips/verify/{slipId} endpoint without auth<br/>to confirm authenticity via QR code (§17.6)
